<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>House Inventory System - User Guide</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>How to Edit an Item</h1>
    <p>This section walks users through editing an existing item.</p>

    <h2>Steps to Edit an Item</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Launch the application</li>
        <li>Locate the item you wish to edit and select the item.</li>
        <li>
            Once item is highlighted blue, you can select the 'Edit Item' button.
            <img src="/edit_item1.png"
                 alt="Select item to edit"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>
            Update any of the items information.
            <img src="/edit_item2.png"
                 alt="Update item information"
                 style="width:500px; height: 600px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>Click 'Save Changes' to update item's information.</li>
        <li>
            The updated information will then be displayed on the inventory table.
            <img src="/edit_item3.png"
                 alt="View updated information"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
    </ol>
</body>
</html>